    "detailed_description": "<h1>Other Games From Taiwan Indie Devs!</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378350/extras/851659b1127902e4f3280f7bb23cb116.poster.avif?t=1640096333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378350/extras/851659b1127902e4f3280f7bb23cb116.webm?t=1640096333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378350/extras/851659b1127902e4f3280f7bb23cb116.mp4?t=1640096333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u300aDrifting : Weight of Feathers\u300b</h2><br>A third-person-action game with a special emphasis on aerial-combat. Players need to utilize grappling hook and acrobatics to fight enemies, solve puzzles to progress through each level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Third-person fast-paced action</strong><br></li><li><strong>Fluid animation and versatile control system</strong><br></li><li><strong>Customizable hair options for Faye</strong><br></li><li><strong>Physics based puzzle solving</strong><br></li><li><strong>Parkour on whale!</strong> \u30fd\uff08\u30fb\u2200\u30fb\uff09\u30ce <br></li><li><strong>Steep learning curve, very hardcore! Play with caution!</strong> \u03a3( \u00b0 \u25b3 \u00b0|||)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378350/extras/4cde5d3bb19833b1ff0f982b66ba8c08.poster.avif?t=1640096333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378350/extras/4cde5d3bb19833b1ff0f982b66ba8c08.webm?t=1640096333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1378350/extras/4cde5d3bb19833b1ff0f982b66ba8c08.mp4?t=1640096333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Download  \u300aDrifting : Weight of Feathers\u300b demo and experience it yourself!",
